# Merchant App — store release copy

When drafting **Google Play** (or other public store) release notes / changelogs for `xituan_app_merchant`:

## Do not volunteer

- Do **not** mention **monthly** subscription, auto-renew, IAP SKU count, Apple AUD list price, StoreKit, App Account Token, or “月订 / 内购套餐周期” style detail **unless** Play / the reviewer already raised that topic in the same review thread.
- Prefer neutral product wording: e.g. subscription / plan / checkout improvements — without billing cadence or store-channel mechanics.

## OK to mention (when it shipped)

- High-level UX: plans screen, checkout flow, order/refund, chat, products, fulfillment map, update prompts, device-availability fixes — without naming IAP product structure.

## Apple vs Play

- Apple App Review replies may need IAP / monthly detail when **Apple** asked. Do not copy that phrasing into **Play** release notes by default.
